# scripts/opcount: `indentbench bench N` indents a list of N records by
# two spaces with json.Indent (PORT-E-JSONINDENT); the cost of one record
# is the slope between the two sizes. The control is hand Go:
# encoding/json's Indent over the same text.
unit record
sizes 20000 120000
args bench {n}
control benchmarks/jsonindent/testdata/control
